WEBVTT

00:09.500 --> 00:11.250
We're deep in the woods.

00:12.880 --> 00:15.170
The delinquents are after the girls.

00:16.540 --> 00:19.080
Keeping the group safe from them is top priority.

00:20.540 --> 00:22.250
And to do that...

00:24.000 --> 00:25.500
...we need to get out of the woods!

02:01.670 --> 02:05.420
<b>Headed to Town</b>

02:02.170 --> 02:04.670
<b>ORC</b>

02:05.670 --> 02:07.170
Everyone stand back.

02:07.500 --> 02:09.130
B-be careful!

02:09.290 --> 02:11.750
Watch and learn a thing or two about battling!

02:11.880 --> 02:13.830
I don't want to hear any complaints!

02:21.330 --> 02:23.830
Heh, talk about sluggish.

02:23.920 --> 02:26.580
<b>PHYSICAL</b>

02:23.920 --> 02:26.580
<b>ATTACKS</b>

02:24.000 --> 02:26.130
Orcs are strong against physical attacks,

02:26.580 --> 02:31.580
<b>MAGIC</b>

02:26.580 --> 02:31.580
<b>ATTACKS</b>

02:26.630 --> 02:30.540
but the Nerds said they can be beat with enough magic.

02:32.250 --> 02:34.210
Do I have any good magic?

02:34.960 --> 02:42.710
<b>MAGIC</b>

02:34.960 --> 02:42.710
<b>TEMPERATURE</b>

02:34.960 --> 02:42.710
<b>WEIGHT</b>

02:34.960 --> 02:42.710
<b>PACKING</b>

02:34.960 --> 02:42.710
<b>GRAND MAGIC</b>

02:34.960 --> 02:42.710
<b>WOOD MAGIC</b>

02:34.960 --> 02:42.710
<b>LIGHTNING MAGIC</b>

02:34.970 --> 02:42.710
<b>MOVEMENT</b>

02:35.130 --> 02:39.460
"Grand Magic" is fire, earth, water, and wind, I think?

02:39.830 --> 02:42.040
All four under one skill, huh?

02:42.710 --> 02:51.460
<b>WIND</b>

02:42.710 --> 02:51.460
<b>WATER</b>

02:42.710 --> 02:51.460
<b>EARTH</b>

02:43.080 --> 02:47.420
Everything but fire I got from my Packing skill.

02:48.170 --> 02:50.880
Just by poking in the dirt and cleaning up.

02:51.500 --> 02:54.380
Guess even the worst skills can come in handy.

03:02.920 --> 03:03.670
Yikes!

03:03.750 --> 03:05.000
Bwah! Uh-oh!

03:05.000 --> 03:06.000
That was close!

03:08.670 --> 03:11.170
Settle down, now!

03:24.670 --> 03:26.380
Wait, it's dead?

03:26.710 --> 03:28.670
I thought physical attacks didn't work?

03:29.210 --> 03:32.290
Staaaaaare...

03:30.290 --> 03:32.290
Okay, I get it!

03:32.290 --> 03:35.960
I'll use magic like the Nerds said next time!

03:40.830 --> 03:44.000
I derived my fire magic from my Temperature skill.

03:46.170 --> 03:47.000
Hup!

03:54.540 --> 03:56.330
Wait, it died?

03:56.580 --> 03:59.130
I thought it was supposed to take lots of magic?

03:59.500 --> 04:00.460
Sheesh!

04:00.460 --> 04:01.290
Again!

04:01.290 --> 04:02.210
Nothing!

04:02.210 --> 04:03.750
Not one bit!

04:03.750 --> 04:08.330
We can't learn a thing from this! You're too strong!

04:13.170 --> 04:14.500
So good!

04:14.670 --> 04:16.580
Really hits the spot!

04:16.580 --> 04:18.000
I feel better already.

04:25.630 --> 04:29.420
Let's make some traps for our foes
with some earth magic...

04:30.000 --> 04:32.080
There! That should do it.

04:32.880 --> 04:36.130
My tent wards off baddies and grants Perception, too.

04:33.080 --> 04:38.790
<b>Magic Tent</b>

04:33.960 --> 04:38.790
<b>Grants Perception skill</b>

04:36.420 --> 04:38.500
This should be enough to look after the girls.

04:38.880 --> 04:40.790
Now for tomorrow's route...

04:42.040 --> 04:45.670
<b>CURRENT LOCATION</b>

04:42.250 --> 04:45.330
I think I derived this map skill from my Appraisal skill.

04:45.670 --> 04:53.130
<b>EQUIPMENT</b>

04:45.670 --> 04:53.130
<b>VILLAGER A SET</b>

04:45.670 --> 04:53.130
<b>CONTACT LENSES</b>

04:45.920 --> 04:50.130
Who woulda thought?
These contacts are almost TOO good.

04:50.380 --> 04:52.420
I lucked out with them.

04:53.130 --> 04:58.580
<b>RIVER</b>

04:53.130 --> 04:58.580
<b>CURRENT LOCATION</b>

04:53.250 --> 04:56.170
The river really starts to snake up ahead.

04:56.500 --> 04:58.580
What's the shortest route we can take...?

04:58.580 --> 05:00.500
<b>RIVER</b>

04:58.580 --> 05:00.500
<b>PERCEPTION</b>

05:01.630 --> 05:02.540
Is it monsters?

05:06.830 --> 05:09.170
Shoot, the delinquents?

05:15.790 --> 05:17.500
Heya, Loner!

05:19.210 --> 05:22.420
Oh! It's just you dumb jocks.

05:22.420 --> 05:24.080
Who you callin' dumb?!

05:24.080 --> 05:24.920
Harsh, dude.

05:24.920 --> 05:26.710
You ever gonna let up?

05:26.710 --> 05:28.330
Still the same, even in this place.

05:28.330 --> 05:30.380
You're dumb if you call someone dumb!

05:29.040 --> 05:30.380
Coulda just not said it!

05:32.080 --> 05:34.460
Is that Haruka and...?

05:34.630 --> 05:38.000
So, what's all this? Why are you out here?

05:38.540 --> 05:40.710
Well, thing is...

05:40.710 --> 05:44.040
Oh! If you're after the girls, then that means...

05:44.580 --> 05:47.080
you're dumb AND creepy, now?

05:47.080 --> 05:48.460
Dumb stalkers?

05:48.460 --> 05:49.920
Yeah right!

05:50.130 --> 05:52.460
We weren't chasing the girls!

05:52.710 --> 05:54.540
We came here to find you!

05:54.750 --> 05:56.460
So this is turning into BL?

05:56.460 --> 05:57.750
No, dude!

05:58.170 --> 06:01.500
Then why are you hiding from the girls?

06:03.500 --> 06:05.080
W-well...

06:05.790 --> 06:09.080
'Cause we can't trust anyone.

06:11.790 --> 06:13.670
You know, right?

06:14.040 --> 06:18.920
That there was a skill scarier than the dudes
with their Puppeteer and Charm skills?

06:19.670 --> 06:24.170
There's only one skill I can think of
that's more dangerous than those.

06:24.580 --> 06:26.040
<b>HIJACK</b>

06:24.580 --> 06:26.040
<b>WELL-BEING</b>

06:24.580 --> 06:26.040
<b>CALISTHENICS</b>

06:24.590 --> 06:26.040
<b>SENSITIVITY</b>

06:27.420 --> 06:28.630
Hijack, huh?

06:28.750 --> 06:32.580
Yeah, the delinquents made a big deal
about Puppeteer and Charm,

06:33.130 --> 06:35.380
but never even mentioned Hijack.

06:36.670 --> 06:39.380
That's gotta mean they don't got it!

06:39.710 --> 06:41.960
So someone else must have it!

06:42.880 --> 06:45.380
You really are dumb, huh?

06:45.540 --> 06:47.880
What if I was the one who had it?

06:50.080 --> 06:52.380
If it was you, I'd be fine with it.

06:52.670 --> 06:54.330
Would put my mind at ease, honestly.

06:54.380 --> 06:56.170
Tsk! What's that supposed to mean?

06:56.420 --> 06:58.540
Do you really have it, though?

06:58.830 --> 07:01.920
Nope. I did learn Subjugate, though.

07:02.830 --> 07:06.290
Uhh, wait. That sounds even worse!

07:06.960 --> 07:13.500
Still, if you're the one who has it, no big deal.
Bet you'll be all alone anyway.

07:13.920 --> 07:16.500
Screw off. What's wrong with being a loner?

07:17.130 --> 07:21.290
Anyway, we just wanted to fill you in on that Hijack skill.

07:21.670 --> 07:23.210
Watch out, yeah?

07:23.210 --> 07:24.500
Wait, that's all?

07:24.710 --> 07:27.880
Yep. We're gonna keep an eye
on those dudes out in the woods.

07:28.710 --> 07:32.920
Tell the Class Rep and everyone we're sorry...

07:35.580 --> 07:36.420
Later, then!

07:39.380 --> 07:42.080
If you need anything, try asking the goblins!

07:42.380 --> 07:44.880
Dumb as they are, you're sure to get along!

07:45.250 --> 07:46.250
Screw you!

07:46.250 --> 07:47.540
Always gotta go too far!

07:47.920 --> 07:49.420
You're the dumb one!

07:51.960 --> 07:53.790
<b>DAY 17</b>

07:53.790 --> 07:57.210
Okay! We're headed through the woods again,
so everyone gear up.

07:57.710 --> 07:59.420
Okay!

07:59.500 --> 08:01.670
Nothing beats a tough chick!

08:01.670 --> 08:03.750
Is there anything cooler than a lady knight?

08:03.920 --> 08:06.960
Time to fight like a beautiful elf!

08:06.960 --> 08:09.080
They sure seem pepped this morning.

08:09.750 --> 08:12.290
Did someone mix some weird mushrooms in breakfast?

08:16.920 --> 08:19.170
Haruka, can we talk?

08:20.750 --> 08:24.420
About Kakizaki and the boys from last night...

08:24.790 --> 08:27.380
Kakizaki? You mean the dumb jock?

08:27.630 --> 08:29.170
Don't be mean.

08:29.460 --> 08:31.630
Oh, yeah! Forgot to tell you.

08:32.250 --> 08:34.630
He asked me to apologize to you for them.

08:35.130 --> 08:37.250
Th-that's fine, but...

08:37.790 --> 08:39.830
I... Well...

08:40.710 --> 08:41.960
You see...

08:42.920 --> 08:43.880
I'm sorry!

08:44.460 --> 08:46.040
Huh? For what?

08:46.170 --> 08:49.040
I swear I was going to tell you.

08:49.710 --> 08:52.170
But the truth is I...

08:52.170 --> 08:53.290
You have Hijack.

08:54.830 --> 08:59.290
What?! Wh-when did you find out? H-how did you know?

08:59.580 --> 09:02.830
It was a secret between me and Oda's group...

09:03.670 --> 09:05.920
Only took one look to figure out.

09:05.920 --> 09:09.040
Bet the jocks are too dumb to realize, though.

09:09.080 --> 09:13.000
But, if you knew, why did you help me?

09:13.580 --> 09:14.750
Aren't you afraid?

09:15.040 --> 09:17.710
Afraid? Why?

09:18.420 --> 09:20.710
B-because...

09:21.420 --> 09:28.960
Hijack is a terrifying skill
that steals someone's skills by taking their life.

09:29.920 --> 09:32.000
Anyone would be afraid of that.

09:32.580 --> 09:34.580
Why should I be?

09:34.960 --> 09:37.540
The nerds weren't either, right?

09:37.880 --> 09:39.420
N-no, but...

09:40.080 --> 09:45.500
They sealed off the delinquents Puppeteer
and Charm skills, but they didn't seal yours.

09:45.920 --> 09:48.130
That says it all.

09:49.750 --> 09:52.290
I'm not sure I follow...

09:52.540 --> 09:54.170
It's obvious.

09:54.750 --> 09:57.040
They were relieved you were the one who has it.

09:58.380 --> 10:02.880
Same goes for me. If you've got it,
there's nothing to worry about.

10:07.750 --> 10:10.880
You've been doing nothing but cry lately, huh?

10:10.880 --> 10:16.880
Th-that's... your fault, you know.

10:20.130 --> 10:23.540
I've been framed! I didn't do anything!

10:24.960 --> 10:29.040
No, you've done so much.

10:31.540 --> 10:34.380
Thank you, Haruka.

10:36.460 --> 10:38.670
We're making good progress, so let's rest up!

10:38.670 --> 10:39.540
Finally!

10:39.540 --> 10:40.540
Yay!

10:40.540 --> 10:41.830
I'm beat...

10:41.830 --> 10:46.130
<b>CHEAP PRICES</b>

10:41.830 --> 10:47.830
<b>SPECIAL SALE</b>

10:41.880 --> 10:44.500
Listen up! I've got some great juice!

10:44.710 --> 10:46.210
Extra cheap, too!

10:44.920 --> 10:47.830
<b>Berry Juice</b>

10:46.210 --> 10:47.830
You're charging us?!

10:48.130 --> 10:51.880
Sorry sir, I'm broke, but can I pay in other ways?

10:52.250 --> 10:53.830
Spice up the deal for me!

10:53.830 --> 10:55.170
Haruka?!

10:55.170 --> 10:57.290
A-all sold out!

10:55.830 --> 10:58.750
<b>SOLD OUT</b>

10:57.460 --> 10:59.130
That's not the issue!

10:58.750 --> 10:59.540
<b>SOLD OUT</b>

10:59.380 --> 11:01.830
Sheesh. Quit charging your friends!

11:01.330 --> 11:03.960
<b>I wanted juice...</b>

11:01.830 --> 11:03.880
I wanted some juice...

11:06.290 --> 11:07.710
I'm exhausted...

11:07.710 --> 11:09.040
We've been going forever...

11:09.330 --> 11:13.130
We're ahead of schedule,
but we'll be stuck camping again tonight.

11:14.710 --> 11:16.830
Oh! There's a good looking riverside.

11:17.130 --> 11:19.040
Good chance to try out something.

11:19.540 --> 11:22.960
Class Rep. You all can handle yourselves, so...

11:23.290 --> 11:25.790
Maybe I'll go ahead and scout or something?

11:25.790 --> 11:29.040
I'd feel better if that wasn't a question.

11:29.540 --> 11:30.750
Want me to go with you?

11:30.880 --> 11:33.500
Nope! You handle things here!

11:34.250 --> 11:35.420
What?!

11:36.250 --> 11:37.210
Sheesh!

11:42.630 --> 11:44.960
First I use Magic Wrap!

11:48.750 --> 11:52.420
Then I use Weight magic to make myself lighter!

11:53.040 --> 11:54.960
Even without OP skills...

11:55.380 --> 11:57.460
...once I pair things together...

11:59.420 --> 12:00.290
...I can...

12:01.380 --> 12:02.250
...go faster!

12:02.710 --> 12:03.710
And...

12:04.580 --> 12:05.460
...be lighter!

12:06.210 --> 12:10.460
I can fly!

12:13.750 --> 12:15.420
WHOA!

12:21.460 --> 12:23.330
Huh? Am I falling?

12:41.170 --> 12:46.630
I-if I hadn't used Magic Wrap to boost
my physical fitness that mighta killed me...

12:46.630 --> 12:48.920
Found our next route, though...

12:49.080 --> 12:51.790
How did you get that beat up from scouting?!

12:51.790 --> 12:53.750
I got launched up really high...

12:54.250 --> 12:56.130
...and sorta fell, I guess?

12:56.130 --> 12:57.580
What?!

12:57.750 --> 13:01.920
That Company Communicator skill of yours
doesn't work at all, does it?

13:01.920 --> 13:05.080
Turns out the sky is scarier than any monster.

13:05.080 --> 13:08.710
See? You're still communicating nothing!

13:08.830 --> 13:13.750
I mean, when you're normally a loner
with no company you don't communicate at all...

13:14.250 --> 13:15.790
Oh, I know!

13:16.000 --> 13:18.580
I got a bunch of berries. We could make some juice.

13:18.580 --> 13:19.290
Hmph!

13:19.500 --> 13:22.250
Yay! Juice!

13:22.250 --> 13:24.710
Hey! This is for her!

13:23.500 --> 13:26.210
Juice! Juice!

13:24.710 --> 13:26.210
Stop!

13:26.920 --> 13:30.670
Thanks to my scouting we made great progress today.

13:31.210 --> 13:32.750
You know, other than...

13:32.880 --> 13:34.670
We found our lost girl!

13:32.880 --> 13:34.670
You're going to be okay.

13:35.080 --> 13:36.080
This bit.

13:37.500 --> 13:38.080
Take that!

13:38.080 --> 13:39.330
Why you...!

13:38.080 --> 13:39.330
And this.

13:45.670 --> 13:46.960
Stop! Don't push! Wait!

13:48.250 --> 13:50.210
And this bit, too.

13:53.330 --> 13:55.460
But after all that...

14:04.540 --> 14:06.000
We made it out of the woods!

14:08.750 --> 14:09.710
We did it!

14:09.710 --> 14:10.920
We really did!

14:10.920 --> 14:12.380
Yay!

14:12.380 --> 14:14.080
We did it, Haruka!

14:14.290 --> 14:15.080
Yep.

14:15.080 --> 14:18.080
Girls, I bet the town isn't far now!

14:18.880 --> 14:22.460
Better stay more alert now that we're out in the open.

14:23.420 --> 14:26.130
Hmm. Those hills block my view.

14:29.710 --> 14:34.960
<b>CLAIRVOYANCE</b>

14:29.710 --> 14:34.960
<b>PERCEPTION</b>

14:29.710 --> 14:34.960
<b>ENEMY DETECTION</b>

14:29.710 --> 14:34.960
<b>MAGIC CONTROL</b>

14:29.710 --> 14:34.960
<b>VANISH</b>

14:29.710 --> 14:34.960
<b>STEALTH</b>

14:29.710 --> 14:34.960
<b>PARALLEL THINKING</b>

14:29.720 --> 14:34.960
<b>SERIAL THINKING</b>

14:29.720 --> 14:34.960
<b>DASH</b>

14:29.720 --> 14:34.960
<b>AIRWALK</b>

14:30.210 --> 14:33.920
"Airwalk?" Did I derive that from my Walking skill?

14:35.830 --> 14:37.330
Whoa! No way!

14:39.210 --> 14:40.880
Hmm? Haruka?

14:42.670 --> 14:46.290
Hey! Haruka! Why are you walking on air?!

14:46.830 --> 14:47.960
Are you listening?

14:48.710 --> 14:52.210
Hey! Don't ignore me!

14:52.580 --> 14:56.460
Oh! That's no celestial beauty, that's the Class Rep!

14:57.130 --> 15:00.880
Gosh, you've sure gone up high.

15:01.500 --> 15:05.380
Yeah. Gimme a minute
to make sure things are safe out there.

15:08.790 --> 15:14.040
Yep. Things look peaceful, so there's nothing to-

15:15.540 --> 15:17.920
Whoa! Our first isekai natives!

15:17.920 --> 15:19.630
Our first real villagers!

15:23.920 --> 15:28.380
Some old guys and folks in armor.
The isekai folk are being attacked.

15:28.830 --> 15:29.630
What?!

15:29.630 --> 15:33.130
Wh-what do we do? We have to help, right?

15:33.460 --> 15:38.290
Getting attacked by monsters
doesn't mean they're good people.

15:39.790 --> 15:41.380
These girls are too trusting.

15:42.420 --> 15:46.130
W-we have to hurry. Our fastest will go.

15:46.630 --> 15:47.420
Yeah!

15:47.790 --> 15:49.880
You won't make it even if you run.

15:50.290 --> 15:52.380
And what will you do if they're actually bandits?

15:54.540 --> 15:57.040
I wouldn't take the risk.

15:58.000 --> 16:03.420
Haruka! I-if they're bad guys and hurt us...

16:04.040 --> 16:05.420
...then I'll fight!

16:06.000 --> 16:09.330
But if they aren't...

16:10.540 --> 16:11.960
...then I want to help them!

16:15.210 --> 16:17.330
I figured she'd say that.

16:19.380 --> 16:20.580
I'll go, then.

16:21.750 --> 16:23.380
B-but...

16:23.750 --> 16:27.500
That's the whole reason I'm here.

16:29.080 --> 16:30.580
Haruka...

16:35.460 --> 16:39.170
Like I said, I can't run there in time.

16:40.170 --> 16:44.040
The Magic Wrap and Weight magic
I used yesterday won't even cut it.

16:46.000 --> 16:48.210
Time to try something new.

16:49.170 --> 16:51.210
I'll use Magic Wrap to boost my physical fitness,

16:52.250 --> 16:54.170
and Weight magic to make me lighter.

16:54.750 --> 16:57.000
Then I'll use my Grand Magic...

16:58.540 --> 16:59.630
...to make some wind...

17:00.880 --> 17:02.130
...and fly on it!

17:19.460 --> 17:21.290
Then I'll use Airwalk!

17:24.000 --> 17:27.710
No way! This could take me anywhere!

17:28.670 --> 17:30.960
Hmm? Huh? Bwah?!

17:32.420 --> 17:34.960
Class Rep?! What the heck?!

17:35.830 --> 17:39.500
I got caught in your wind magic!

17:39.960 --> 17:43.000
Wait! Haruka! Look ahead! Ahead!

17:43.000 --> 17:43.880
STOP!

17:43.880 --> 17:47.960
Uhh, humans aren't built to stop that fast...

17:48.630 --> 17:52.460
WHAAAAAAT?!

18:01.130 --> 18:01.630
Wha...?!

18:01.630 --> 18:03.130
What just happened?

18:05.880 --> 18:09.830
Uhh... i-is everyone all right?

18:09.920 --> 18:12.670
Think we oughta be asking that.

18:18.710 --> 18:22.960
You really saved us. I'm Ofter and this is my party.

18:22.960 --> 18:24.580
I'm his pal Gatek.

18:24.580 --> 18:28.880
Cool, guess I can understand people here.

18:29.210 --> 18:33.290
You saved our whole party. Thanks again.

18:33.790 --> 18:36.330
Why were you getting attacked?

18:36.790 --> 18:39.580
Merchants have been getting assaulted,

18:39.580 --> 18:42.790
so the Adventurer's Guild put out
an extermination request.

18:42.790 --> 18:44.790
We thought it'd be some easy cash.

18:44.960 --> 18:47.170
But we'd be dead now without you.

18:47.330 --> 18:49.130
There was a huge wolf, huh?

18:49.380 --> 18:51.250
A Big Green Wolf, yeah.

18:51.830 --> 18:53.830
Wasn't expecting that one...

18:54.170 --> 18:57.960
Gather up everything that's left!
We'll carry it all between us!

18:58.170 --> 19:00.210
That hit our party hard.

19:00.790 --> 19:03.380
How am I gonna pay my bar tab now?

19:03.830 --> 19:06.290
Not much to do until the girls get here.

19:07.960 --> 19:10.170
And the Class Rep's still out.

19:15.380 --> 19:16.130
Hey...

19:16.380 --> 19:19.330
Hmm? Some grilled shrooms? For us?

19:19.330 --> 19:22.920
They're probably pretty worn out, even if they aren't hurt.

19:24.170 --> 19:26.880
This is GOOD! Are these Stamina Caps?!

19:28.420 --> 19:30.460
You're sharing something this rare?

19:30.710 --> 19:32.790
Wait, these are rare?!

19:33.750 --> 19:37.630
Wow, I feel totally recovered!
Stamina Caps are incredible!

19:38.000 --> 19:40.290
You're right! Nothing even hurts anymore!

19:40.460 --> 19:42.460
Glad they like them.

19:42.460 --> 19:43.790
They're so good!

19:43.790 --> 19:44.790
I feel great!

19:51.040 --> 19:54.790
Still, these old guys are partied with babes like this?

19:55.330 --> 19:57.040
That kinda pisses me off.

19:58.040 --> 20:01.210
Umm, Haruka? Why are you looking for a fight?!

20:01.790 --> 20:04.210
A little later, the girls caught up.

20:04.420 --> 20:05.380
Hey!

20:05.580 --> 20:07.380
Class Rep!

20:07.380 --> 20:08.960
Sorry for the wait!

20:08.960 --> 20:10.420
We're here!

20:11.880 --> 20:13.380
An elf!

20:13.380 --> 20:14.920
Can I shake your hand?

20:15.210 --> 20:18.790
And after the girls flocked to the ladies
like Taka****ka fans...

20:19.920 --> 20:22.290
We got guided to town.

20:25.790 --> 20:28.960
Okay, folks, we can see it from here!

20:33.790 --> 20:35.330
That's Omui.

20:39.670 --> 20:41.420
Yay!

20:41.420 --> 20:42.960
Let's race there!

20:42.130 --> 20:46.080
Quit running! What are you, kids at an amusement park?!

20:50.170 --> 20:51.210
Okay!

21:00.080 --> 21:02.920
Everyone, here we go!

21:03.080 --> 21:05.380
Ready...?

21:06.500 --> 21:10.460
We're here!

21:15.750 --> 21:18.290
All right, that was some good leveling.

21:20.330 --> 21:24.210
Let's track down and hit those girls!

21:24.460 --> 21:26.080
Hell yeah!

21:26.080 --> 21:27.290
Finally!

21:27.290 --> 21:29.880
We waited so long I'm practically an old fart now!

21:29.880 --> 21:31.880
Like the geezer in the white room!

21:32.210 --> 21:38.710
I-If you're going to attack the girls, you should
get your Charm and Puppeteer skills unsealed.

21:39.380 --> 21:41.580
Hey, nice idea!

21:41.580 --> 21:43.500
With both of those...

21:46.000 --> 21:50.130
Only someone with a Seal skill can unseal 'em, right?

21:50.540 --> 21:54.130
Guess that means we find the nerds first.

21:54.420 --> 21:57.330
And when we do, they are SO in for it!

21:57.880 --> 21:58.580
Yep!

21:58.580 --> 21:59.920
We'll show 'em!

21:59.920 --> 22:01.630
'Specially that four-eyes!

22:04.380 --> 22:08.540
This is bad. They're making their move!
